| Speed: the hd clip without checksums (-t). vcdec's copy (the default),
| then zero-copy: held and released (-Z), held and every byte read once
| as a player would (-Z -R), the same with 4 buffers, and 4 held at a time
| in 6 buffers. Each run says where the time inside vcdec went. Reports to
| ResultT.
| (a GCCSDK program: needs SharedUnixLibrary and ARMEABISupport loaded)
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error This needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.
WimpSlot -min 16384K -max 16384K
Remove <Obey$Dir>.ResultT
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -Z -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -Z -R -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -Z -R -B 4 -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
Run <Obey$Dir>.vcdectest -t -H 4 -B 6 -R -o <Obey$Dir>.ResultT <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.mp4 <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.crc <Obey$Dir>.clips.hd.sig
